      "Pagination > PaginationContent > PaginationItem wrapping one control each.",
      "Compose window logic upstream: first page, ellipsis, window around current, last page.",
    ],
    agentNotes: [
      "No page-count/current-page math props — pass finished URLs. The CMS pagination loader (buildTruncatedPageUrls) is the canonical producer.",
